 $Y$ given that $X=x:$\n\n| ${f}_{Y|X}(y\\,|\\,x)$ | $Y=1$ | $Y=2$ |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $X=2$ | $\\frac{4}{5}$ | $\\frac{1}{5}$ | $1$ |\n| $X=4$ | $\\frac{3}{7}$ | $\\frac{4}{7}$ | $1$ |\n| $X=6$ | $\\frac{1}{2}$ | $\\frac{1}{2}$ | $1$ |\n\nFinally, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[Y\\,|\\,X=4] & ={\\sum }_{y}y\\,{f}_{Y|X}(y\\,|\\,4) \\\\  & =1\\cdot \\frac{3}{7}+2\\cdot \\frac{4}{7} \\\\  & =\\frac{11}{7}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534639 17592186045417 true] [17592186430551 1068 #edb/ref 17592186430531 13194139534639 17592186045417 true] [17592186430551 1069 "q-146190" 13194139534639 17592186045417 true] [17592186430551 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139534639 17592186045417 true] [17592186430551 1071 "| $y$ | $2$ | $3$ | $5$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| ${f}_{Y|X}(y\\,|\\,3)$ | $0.25$ | $0.6$ | $0.15$ |\n\nFind the $\\text{E}[Y\\,|\\,X=3]$ given that the conditional probability mass function ${f}_{Y|X}(y\\,|\\,3)$ is shown in the table above." 13194139534639 17592186045417 true] [17592186430551 1072 #uuid "ce8c7ab6-3d50-5c46-82fd-86a6317c7440" 13194139534639 17592186045417 true] [17592186430551 1074 "The conditional expected value of  $Y$ given $X=x$ is defined by\n\n$$\n\\text{E}[Y\\,|\\,X=x]={\\sum }_{y}y\\,{f}_{Y|X}(y\\,|\\,x).\n$$\n\nTherefore, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[Y\\,|\\,X=3] & ={\\sum }_{y}y\\,{f}_{Y|X}(y\\,|\\,3) \\\\  & =2\\cdot 0.25+3\\cdot 0.6+5\\cdot 0.15 \\\\  & =3.05.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534639 17592186045417 true] [17592186430552 1068 #edb/ref 17592186430538 13194139534639 17592186045417 true] [17592186430552 1069 "q-146285" 13194139534639 17592186045417 true] [17592186430552 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139534639 17592186045417 true] [17592186430552 1071 "| $f$ | $Y=4$ | $Y=5$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $X=1$ | $\\frac{1}{12}$ | $\\frac{1}{6}$ |\n| $X=3$ | $\\frac{1}{6}$ | $\\frac{1}{12}$ |\n| $X=5$ | $\\frac{1}{4}$ | $\\frac{1}{4}$ |\n\nFind $\\text{E}[X\\,|\\,Y=5]$ given that the ra